WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.350
The opposing Juri jumps toward the grounded attacker.

2
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.150
Forward heavy catches the airborne Juri.

3
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:02.350
OD Fuhajin continues the anti-air juggle.

4
00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:02.950
Raw Drive Rush reaches a crouching-heavy juggle.

5
00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:03.950
OD Ankensatsu continues the juggle before the Super.

6
00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:07.350
Sakkai Fuhazan activates after the OD special.

7
00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:07.800
The Level 1 juggle completes against the opposing Juri.
